   "notes": "Joint PVT fit for pure H2O ice VI. Published molar V0=14.17(2) cm^3/mol is converted to the Z=10 unit cell. The second-order Birch-Murnaghan form fixes K0'=4; dK/dT was fixed to zero because no temperature dependence was detectable. The numeric domains give the extrema of the ice-VI measurements tabulated in the paper.",
